    "text": "<p><math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>g</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mi>'</mi></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>g</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>.</mo><msup><mi>g</mi><mi>'</mi></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>Put <math><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mi>'</mi></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>g</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>a</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><msup><mi>g</mi><mi>'</mi></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>a</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mi>'</mi></msup><mfenced><mi>b</mi></mfenced><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mi>'</mi></msup><mfenced><mi>b</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac></math></p>",
